{"version":1,"content":"<p>11月18日周三，在加州聖克拉拉舉行的黃仁勳辭職後首次全員大會上，英偉達高管向員工發表講話。據一位匿名的與會人士透露，英偉達臨時行政總裁科萊特·克雷斯周三在公司自創始人黃仁勳辭職後的首次全員大會上，對員工表示「讓我們向前看」。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1587004.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-18T21:31:45.864563+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":118,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-18T21:24:14+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-18T21:24:55.055738+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-18T21:24:55.055738+00:00","content_hash":"3957ba12a20e4baec40a47001390177b324cf7b1d19ec40156637343851aeb1f","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}